# This module is generated from tools/cmathlong.dsl (itself written by tools/cmathlonggen.py) by tools/build.py.

cmathlong is module
cmathlong purpose "math.h's transcendental long double functions in SemanticScript: sinl, cosl, tanl, asinl, acosl, atanl, atan2l, expl, exp2l, expm1l, logl, log2l, log10l, log1pl, powl, cbrtl, hypotl, sinhl, coshl, tanhl, asinhl, acoshl, atanhl, erfl, erfcl, tgammal, lgammal, lgammal_r, and fmal, on 320-bit numbers for x87, binary128 and double layouts alike"
